WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.083
Hey!

00:00:01.083 --> 00:00:02.440
Conan O'Brien here.

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.340
I hope everyone watching this,
right now, is being safe.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.830
I hope you're washing your
hands, and I hope like me,

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:11.430
you're hunkered down at home.

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:13.630
I thought maybe I could be of some help,

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:15.620
by offering a life hack.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.380
Lot of people out there are worried,

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.240
right now, about toilet paper.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:20.610
People are going to stores,

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:22.980
and they seem to want more toilet paper

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:26.160
than they could ever
use in a 6-year period,

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.680
if they had continual diarrhea.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.050
And now it's gone!

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.600
It's all gone and people are panicking.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:33.820
I'm here to assure you,

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.130
that are many things around the house,

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:38.040
you can use instead of toilet paper,

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.090
that work just as well.

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:43.460
For example, CVS receipts.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.000
CVS receipts are long.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.580
This was for just six Tic Tacs I bought.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.400
I never throw 'em away, 'cause
I knew this day would come.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.440
Also, we all have these
around the house, Valpak.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:55.920
Valpak coupons.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.480
I know you never really use 'em.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.210
Now, look at that,

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:02.030
you can clean yourself with
(chuckles) colorful coupons.

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.840
You probably have some
stocks around the house,

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.600
that aren't really worth
as much as they used to be.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.026
These are mostly stocks I
bought for Carnival Cruise Line.

00:01:10.026 --> 00:01:12.276
(laughing)

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:16.840
That laugh was too hard and too long.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:17.840
I apologize.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.840
You can use souvenir T-shirts.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:22.380
T-shirts someone gave
you, you don't value,

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:24.180
you hate 'em, you can't get rid of 'em.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.590
I have thousands of these.

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:29.220
So I've been wiping my
ass with these 24/7.

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:33.380
Another thing, souvenir
baseball caps, like this one.

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:35.840
You're thinking, "Baseball cap,
how does that work, Conan?"

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:37.310
You take your fist.
(hat thuds)

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:40.150
You put it in the ball
of the hat, right there.

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:43.270
You jam that up in the area,
and you work it around.

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:45.380
Just work that around!

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:46.960
Works better than toilet paper.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:49.270
Really clean it, clean it well!

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:51.350
One thing I would not recommend.

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:52.963
Marshmallow Peeps.

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:56.120
Trust me.

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:58.030
It's not pleasant,

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:02.040
and you end up kind of feeling
bad for the little chick.

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:03.700
Finally.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:04.763
We all have 'em,

00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:08.330
pretentious coffee table books.

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:10.840
I've had this on my coffee
table for nine years.

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:12.853
I don't know who De Kooning is!

00:02:14.213 --> 00:02:15.700
What is that?

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:17.420
That's not art!

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:18.953
Wipe your ass with it.

00:02:18.953 --> 00:02:21.010
(book slams)

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:22.660
That's my life hack.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:24.270
I hope it's of use to you.

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:26.490
Stay well, take care,

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:27.640
we'll talk to you soon.

